  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/ProcessoSantJoaquimOnda.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; widows: 1;\">(149 fotos) El barrio San Joaqu&iacute;n de Onda ha festejado este domingo a su patr&oacute;n, con misa y procesi&oacute;n por la tarde,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; widows: 1;\">y</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/VarietatsSantJoaquimOnda.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; widows: 1;\">con el tradicional espect&aacute;culo de variedades nocturno con artistas del propios barrio y otras personas que han colaborado.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; widows: 1;\">El acto ha sido presentado, como cada a&ntilde;o, por el locutor de Onda TV Ram&oacute;n Cabedo Esteve.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17provessovarietes/img_2711.jpg\" alt=\"img_2711\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17provessovarietes/img_2713.jpg\" alt=\"img_2713\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17provessovarietes/img_2715.jpg\" alt=\"img_2715\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17provessovarietes/img_2717.jpg\" alt=\"img_2717\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17provessovarietes/img_2718.jpg\" alt=\"img_2718\" sty